# Migration assessment: `OVHcloud`

- Inventory file: `inventory.json`
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `OVHcloud` snapshot from `https://www.ovhcloud.com/en/public-cloud/regions-availability/`, retrieved 2026-11-10

## Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 3 |
| partial | 1 |
| none | 2 |
| total | 6 |

## Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` (tie: `Object Storage 3-AZ`) | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL 3-AZ`) | `Managed PostgreSQL` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `fn-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `i-0123456789abcdef0` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` (tie: `Metal Instances`) | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `misc-example` | `AWS::CloudFormation::CustomResource` | `unclassified` | none |  | not classified |
| `partial-example` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` (tie: `Metal Instances`) | `Instances` does not offer `high-availability` |

## Required changes

- `partial-example`: `high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

## Blockers

- `fn-example`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`: not classified
